{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/program' data-target='computer\/program' data-title='Program'>\r\n\t\t\tProgram\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/program\/nitgen_access_manager' data-target='computer\/program\/nitgen_access_manager' data-title='Nitgen Access Manager'>\r\n\t\t\tNitgen Access Manager\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"(You may refer to the chart/table given in the manual that specifies what pre-requisites be installed on which OS).","label":"Setup","prevArticle":null,"nextArticle":null,"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<h2>1. Install the prerequisites: (Included in installation media)<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\t(You may refer to the chart\/table given in the manual that specifies what pre-requisites be installed on which OS).\n\t<\/p>\n\t<ol class=\"list-number content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>Install SQL Server 2005.<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ol>\n\t<ol class=\"list-number content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>The installation dir has a .bat file that contains the initialization parameters.<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ol>\n\t<ol class=\"list-number content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>copy the content of this.<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ol>\n\t<ol class=\"list-number content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>this contains a password - that is recommended to be changed.<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ol>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>3. Run: XXXsql.exe &lt;content from .bat file&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<ol class=\"list-number content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>Install the latest service pack (perhaps sp3).<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ol>\n\t<h2>- On Win 7 or newer you will be warned of incompatibility thus u must.<\/h2>\n\t<ol class=\"list-number content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>Start SQL Management Studio Express.<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ol>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<strong>(You may receive error.<\/strong> No Process Is on the Other End of the Pipe.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Then&gt; restart app)<\/h2>\n\t<h4>4. Login with<\/h4>\n\t<h4>1. Username<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tSa.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>2. Password:        &lt;what you had put in a.i.1&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<ol class=\"list-number content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>Install Access Manager Server.<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ol>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>1. SQL Server path: &lt;ComputerName\\SQLServer&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tGets from SQL Management Studio.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>2. Username\/Password        &lt;as above&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h4>3. When asked for: ids_sql_install_path<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tSpecify the directory where the Nitgen DB Files will be placed.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tFor example, C:\\ProgramData\\Nitgen\\DB\\.\n\t<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/program\/nitgen_access_manager\/setup\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/program\/nitgen_access_manager\/setup\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='item_block-disabled sidebar-nav-norm sidebar-n